# What GitHub counts as this repo's code.
#
# Linguist measures every tracked file by default, and by that measure most of
# this repo is somebody else's: the vendored emulator under arduboy-legacy is
# 299 of its 362 C/C++ files on its own. Left alone, the language bar describes
# dependencies rather than the engine.
#
# These marks are accurate rather than flattering -- each one names code that
# is genuinely vendored, generated, or archived.

# Third-party source kept in-tree.
vendor/**                       linguist-vendored
engines/arduboy-legacy/tools/** linguist-vendored

# Archived, read-only, not built. Held to the rules of the repo it came from.
engines/arduboy-legacy/**       linguist-vendored
games/rpg-arduboy/**            linguist-vendored

# Prose, not implementation.
docs/**                         linguist-documentation
**/docs/**                      linguist-documentation

# Reference texts, checked in so the design canon can cite them.
games/selva-oscura/docs/reference/** linguist-documentation
